{{!
	The HTML part of the mail inviting an admitted address to log in.

	Table layout and inline styles throughout, because a mail client is not a browser: the classic
	Outlook still in use across the companies this extension serves lays out with Word's engine,
	which has no flex, no grid, and no stylesheet to read. Nor does it honour max-width, so the width
	the card is held to is given to it again in a table only that engine sees. Colours are given as
	bgcolor beside the style carrying them, for the webmail clients that drop the shorthand. The
	rounded corners it will not do either way.

	Colours, spacing and type sizes are Codex's, spelled out rather than referred to: a mail carries
	no stylesheet, so there is nothing for a custom property to resolve against and no compiler to
	resolve a LESS variable. Each is named in a comment beside its value. The line heights are set to
	suit a message read at arm's length, and are nobody's tokens.

	The one thing fetched from the network is fetched by the reader: an invitation to a wiki they
	have not seen is useless without the way in, so the login page is linked. What the link says is
	the address it goes to, character for character, so that nothing here hides where a click lands.
	There is no image, since clients block remote ones by default and would show a broken box where a
	logo went. The address is left to read as an address: a client that finds a link in it of its own
	accord is doing that on its own.

	Every string arrives localised, in the wiki's own language, which is why the direction to read it
	in is given here too. The URL keeps its own direction, being read left to right in every
	language. Mustache escapes what it interpolates, so none of it can carry markup out of a wiki's
	site name.
}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html dir="{{dir}}" lang="{{lang}}">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>{{siteName}}</title>
</head>
{{! background-color-neutral }}
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#eaecf0;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#eaecf0" style="border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#eaecf0;">
	<tr>
		{{! spacing-150, spacing-75 }}
		<td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
			<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="480" align="center"><tr><td><![endif]-->
			{{! background-color-base, border-color-subtle, border-radius-base }}
			<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-collapse:collapse;max-width:480px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #c8ccd1;border-radius:2px;">
				<tr>
					{{! font-size-x-large, font-weight-bold, color-base, spacing-150 }}
					<td align="center" style="padding:24px 24px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:28px;color:#202122;text-align:center;">
						{{siteName}}
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					{{! font-size-medium, color-base, spacing-25 }}
					<td align="center" style="padding:4px 24px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#202122;text-align:center;">
						{{intro}}
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					{{! spacing-100, spacing-150 }}
					<td align="center" style="padding:16px 24px 0;">
						{{! background-color-neutral-subtle, border-color-subtle }}
						<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#f8f9fa" style="border-collapse:collapse;background-color:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #c8ccd1;">
							<tr>
								{{! font-size-medium, color-base, spacing-100 }}
								<td align="center" dir="ltr" style="padding:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#202122;text-align:center;word-break:break-all;">
									{{! color-progressive }}
									<a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="color:#3366cc;text-decoration:underline;">{{loginUrl}}</a>
								</td>
							</tr>
						</table>
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					{{! font-size-small, color-subtle, spacing-150 }}
					<td align="center" style="padding:14px 24px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#54595d;text-align:center;">
						{{instructions}}
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					{{! font-size-x-small, color-subtle, spacing-100, spacing-150 }}
					<td align="center" style="padding:16px 24px 24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#54595d;text-align:center;">
						{{disclaimer}}
					</td>
				</tr>
			</table>
			<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
